  "slug": "catering-order-sign-in-sheet-form",
  "title": "Catering Order Sign-In Sheet Form",
  "subtitle": "Sign the catering crew on and off a delivery, record travel and on-site hours, and capture the client's signature for the delivery itself.",
  "description": "An original crew and delivery register for off-premise catering. It records the delivery identity and crew plan, each crew member's kitchen departure, on-site, and return times, the on-site delivery acknowledgment signed by the client contact, exceptions such as a refused signature or unlogged return, and an accountable closeout.",
  "use_case": "Use for one catering delivery when the kitchen must know who travelled, how long they were on site, and who at the client accepted the delivery. The register closes when every crew member is logged back and the delivery has been acknowledged or the refusal recorded.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
  "sections": [
